				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T05:43:33" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>見物客その１
MAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
